   <refbody>    <section>
      <p>To change the interface language:</p>
      <ol>
    <li>Log in to the SMS mobile application.</li>
    <li>Tap Settings on the bottom menu.</li>
    <li><p>Scroll down and tap Language.</p>
      <p>The <b>Settings</b> page is displayed.</p>
               <fig>
                  <title>Image118</title>
                  <image height="501" href="../media/image118.jpg" placement="break" width="257">
                     <alt>placeholder</alt>
                  </image>
               </fig>
               <p>Figure  Settings - Language option</p></li>
    <li>Tap Language again.</li>
    <li>Tap the required language from the list to change the mobile interface language.</li>
    </ol>
    </section>
